              <p>macOS, iOS, and iPadOS. iOS and iPadOS are supported only with MDM turned on. To learn more, check out the <a href="/docs/get-started/faq#what-host-operating-systems-does-fleet-support">supported OS versions</a>.</p>
            </div>
