              <span class="fa fa-angle-down"></span>
            </p>
            <div purpose="accordion-answer" id="accordion__body-faq-4" class="collapse" aria-labelledby="accordion__header-faq-4">
              <p>Yes. User Enrollment with a Managed Apple Account keeps work data separate. To learn more, check out the <a href="/guides/enroll-byod-ios-ipados-hosts">BYOD enrollment guide</a>.</p>
